<title>USA: Woolworth names new VP/controller.</title>
<headline>Woolworth names new VP/controller.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolworth Corp said on Thursday it has named Bruce Hartman vice president and controller.</p>
<p>His appointment is effective November 18. He succeeds John Wozniak, who is leaving the company at the end of the fiscal year in January.</p>
<p>Most recently, Hartman was chief financial officer of May Department Stores Co's Filene's stores.</p>
